{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43293","headline":"暗投明珠 · 苑䛆","name":"暗投明珠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"至宝欣怀日，良兹岂可俦。\n神光非易鉴，夜色信难投。\n错落珍寰宇，圆明隔浅流。\n精灵辞合浦，素彩耀神州。\n抱影希人识，承时望帝求。\n谁言按劒者，猜忌却生讐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苑䛆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43293.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43293","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}